  "title": "Southland Announces First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Southland Holdings, Inc. (NYSE American: SLND and SLND WS) (“Southland”), a leading provider of specialized infrastructure construction services, today announced financial results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026. Revenue of $172.4 million for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, compared to $239.5 million for the quarter ended March 31, 2025. Gross loss of $4.8 million for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, compared to $21.5 million in gross profit for the quarter end...",
